  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "& his modor wundriende be \u00feam \u00fee be him ges\u00e6de w\u00e6ron. And \u00fea bletsude hig Simeon & cw\u00e6\u00fe to Marian his meder; Loca nu \u00fees is on hryre, & on \u00e6ryst asett And his swurd \u00feine sawle \u00feurhf\u00e6r\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feohtas syn awrigene of manegum heortum. And Anna w\u00e6s witegystre Fanueles dohtor of Asseres m\u00e6g\u00f0e \u00feeos wunude manigne d\u00e6g, & heo & heo w\u00e6s wudewe o\u00f0 feower & hundeahtatig geara. Seo of \u00feam temple ne gewat, d\u00e6ges & nihtes \u00feeowigende on f\u00e6stenum & on halsungum, And \u00feeos & \u00fea hi ealle \u00feing gefyldon \u00e6fter drihtnes \u00e6 hi gehwurfon on Galileam on heora ceastre Nazareth. So\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t cild weox & w\u00e6s gestrangod wisdomes full, & Godes gyfu w\u00e6s on him. & his magas ferdon \u00e6lce gere to Hierusalem on easterd\u00e6ges freolstide. & \u00fea he w\u00e6s twelf wintre hy foron to Hierusalem to \u00fean easterlican freolse \u00e6fter hyra gewunan. And gefylledum dagum \u00fea hig agengehwurfon, belaf se H\u00e6lend on Hierusalem, & his magas \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea comon hig anes d\u00e6ges f\u00e6r, & hine sohton betux his magas & his cu\u00f0an. \u00d0a hig hyne ne fundon hig gewendun to Hierusalem hyne secende. \u00d0a \u00e6fter \u00ferim dagum hig fundon hine on \u00feam temple sittende on middan \u00feam lareowum, hlystende & \u00dea wundrodon hig ealle \u00fee gehyrdon be his gleawscipe, & hys andswarum. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe his modor to him;",
